---
import Layout from '../../layouts/SkateToEscapeLayout.astro';
const base=import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/,'');
const media=`${base}/media/skate-to-escape`;
---
<Layout>
  <section class="escape-hero">
    <img class="escape-hero-art" src={`${media}/hero.jpg`} alt="A rainbow-haired punk skater escapes a crowd of grey businesspeople" width="1672" height="941" fetchpriority="high" />
    <div class="escape-wrap escape-hero-inner">
      <p class="escape-eyebrow"><span class="escape-live-dot"></span> Coming Soon <span class="escape-platforms">iPhone · iPad · Mac</span></p>
      <div class="escape-title"><h1>SKATE TO<br /><span>ESCAPE.</span></h1><span class="escape-stamp">AI SLOP</span></div>
      <p class="escape-lead">Big tricks. Bad career choices.</p>
      <p class="escape-hero-copy">Ride a skateboard or eScooter through a grey business world. Everything around you bursts into colour. Break a few things. Don’t get caught.</p>
      <a class="escape-button" href="#trailer">WATCH THE TRAILER <span aria-hidden="true">↘</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section id="trailer" class="escape-film escape-wrap" aria-labelledby="trailer-title">
    <div class="escape-section-label"><h2 id="trailer-title">THIS IS YOUR ESCAPE.</h2><span>54 SECONDS / SOUND ON</span></div>
    <div class="escape-video-shell">
      <video controls playsinline preload="none" poster={`${media}/trailer-poster.jpg`} aria-label="Skate to Escape cinematic trailer">
        <source src={`${media}/trailer.mp4`} type="video/mp4" />
        <a href={`${media}/trailer.mp4`}>Watch the trailer</a>
      </video>
    </div>
    <div class="escape-film-note"><span>A cinematic look at the game. Gameplay screenshots below.</span><a href={`${media}/trailer-4k.mp4`} download>Download in 4K ↗</a></div>
  </section>
  <section class="escape-playground escape-wrap" aria-labelledby="playground-title">
    <div class="escape-playground-heading"><p class="escape-kicker">YOUR BOARD. THEIR PROBLEM.</p><h2 id="playground-title">THE CITY IS<br />YOUR <em>SKATEPARK.</em></h2></div>
    <div class="escape-mechanics">
      <article><span class="escape-number">01 / GO BIG</span><h3>Charge. Launch. Combo.</h3><p>Hold your jump for a bigger launch. Chain flips and spins in the air, land on a rail and grind into your next trick.</p></article>
      <article><span class="escape-number">02 / MAKE A MESS</span><h3>Leave a mark.</h3><p>Knock over signs, scatter office furniture and send whole buildings tumbling. This city takes arcade physics personally.</p></article>
      <article><span class="escape-number">03 / GET LOST</span><h3>Follow your next spot.</h3><p>Explore the city, the shopping mall and the spiral parking garage. A new marked destination keeps you moving. Getting there is up to you.</p></article>
    </div>
    <div class="escape-sign" aria-hidden="true"><span>NO FUN<br />ALLOWED</span><i></i></div>
  </section>
  <section class="escape-danger">
    <div class="escape-wrap escape-danger-inner">
      <div class="escape-corporate" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 240 330" fill="none"><path d="M70 294V191H116V294M128 294V191H174V294" fill="#363941"/><path d="M57 99H183V206H57Z" fill="#666a72"/><path d="M57 102L29 109V204H54M183 102L211 109V204H186" fill="#4a4e56"/><rect x="85" y="32" width="70" height="65" rx="25" fill="#a0a3aa"/><path d="M78 30H162V48H78Z" fill="#444750"/><path d="M110 109H130L137 169L120 184L103 169Z" fill="#eee"/><path d="M67 294H117V313H61ZM127 294H177L184 313H127Z" fill="#22252b"/></svg><span class="escape-bubble">Just a quick one.<br />Got five minutes?</span></div>
      <div class="escape-danger-copy"><p class="escape-kicker">THEY WANT YOUR SOUL.</p><h2>DON’T GET<br /><em>CAUGHT.</em></h2><p>The suits are after you. Let them catch you and the mohawk goes, the suit comes on, and a tie seals the deal.</p><p>Shake it off. Start again. Or switch off captures in Free Ride and enjoy the chaos at your own pace.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="escape-shots escape-wrap" aria-labelledby="shots-title">
    <div class="escape-section-label"><h2 id="shots-title">ACTUAL GAME. ACTUAL CHAOS.</h2><span>IN DEVELOPMENT</span></div>
    <div class="escape-gallery">
      <figure class="escape-mac"><a href={`${media}/mac.jpg`} target="_blank" aria-label="View Mac gameplay screenshot"><img src={`${media}/mac.jpg`} alt="Skate to Escape on Mac: the punk rider on a colourful ramp surrounded by grey city buildings" width="1800" height="1350" loading="lazy" /></a><figcaption>Mac <span>Keyboard controls. Same bad decisions.</span></figcaption></figure>
      <figure class="escape-phone"><a href={`${media}/iphone.jpg`} target="_blank" aria-label="View iPhone gameplay screenshot"><img src={`${media}/iphone.jpg`} alt="Skate to Escape on iPhone with touch steering and jump, boost and trick buttons" width="1600" height="736" loading="lazy" /></a><figcaption>iPhone & iPad <span>Touch controls. Pocket-sized escape.</span></figcaption></figure>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="escape-closing escape-wrap"><img src={`${media}/icon.png`} alt="Skate to Escape icon" width="96" height="96" loading="lazy" /><p class="escape-kicker">iPHONE / iPAD / MAC</p><h2>COMING <em>SOON.</em></h2><p>Still building. Still breaking things.</p><a class="escape-text-link" href="#trailer">Watch the trailer again ↑</a></section>
  <details class="escape-credits escape-wrap"><summary>Trailer credits</summary><p>Thanks to the artists who made the trailer sound this good.</p><a href={`${media}/TRAILER-CREDITS.txt`}>Music, sound effects and licenses ↗</a></details>
</Layout>
